RR
m^{rr}*sin(theta_1)*sin(theta_2) - I*m^{rr}*sin(theta_1)*cos(theta_2) + I*m^{rr}*sin(theta_2)*cos(theta_1) + m^{rr}*cos(theta_1)*cos(theta_2)
RL
-m^{rl}*sin(theta_1)*sin(theta_2) - I*m^{rl}*sin(theta_1)*cos(theta_2) - I*m^{rl}*sin(theta_2)*cos(theta_1) + m^{rl}*cos(theta_1)*cos(theta_2)
LR
-m^{lr}*sin(theta_1)*sin(theta_2) + I*m^{lr}*sin(theta_1)*cos(theta_2) + I*m^{lr}*sin(theta_2)*cos(theta_1) + m^{lr}*cos(theta_1)*cos(theta_2)
LL
m^{ll}*sin(theta_1)*sin(theta_2) + I*m^{ll}*sin(theta_1)*cos(theta_2) - I*m^{ll}*sin(theta_2)*cos(theta_1) + m^{ll}*cos(theta_1)*cos(theta_2)
